    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote4" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>
          <xhtml:span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5;">Current year distributions were $35,786,000, which exceeded unappropriated retained income by $6,926,259 as of March 31, 2026. Such excess was recorded against additional paid-in capital.</xhtml:span>
        </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
